WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Mark: I'm really proud of you guys.
*ominous piano music begins*

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.480
We killed it at PAX this year.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.560
And now we get to go home.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.720
And we get to see our families again.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.000
We get to...see Chica again.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.920
(News report: ...may result in downed trees and scattered power outages.)

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.820
Ethan: You're all I got left.
*talks to the  microwavable pizza box

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.180
M: Can we brave it? Maybe the flights not cancelled?

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.660
Tyler: It-It's cancelled.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.200
M: What are we going to eat? We only got bagel bites.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.580
E: I ate 'em all last night...I was hungry!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.520
M: You bastard! E: No! T: No, you'll kill him! *Everyone screaming*

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.860
Listen...there's no birds,

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:42.180
There's no animals...there's NOTHING.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.880
Amy: Kathryn, It's not...It's not like this is the first time this has happened.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.720
I mean- I mean it could be worse...right?

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.680
E: *screams* Everyone's already dead!(News report in background)

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.980
Mark &amp; Ethan: NO...NO...NO!
Mark: You put em down!

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:58.760
M: Chica...I'll be with you ok.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:02.020
E: Something's wrong with Mark...he's letting snow in!

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.200
M: I found more food.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:09.240
If it's good enough for Chica...it's good enough for us.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.260
Isn't that right?

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:13.600
Ethan: No!..Stop.
Kathryn: Noo!.. Nope.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.480
K: Ugh.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.380
M: You need to embrace the cold...Embrace it! *ominous music stops)

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:20.440
Kathryn: Nope.
Mark: It's destiny!

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.360
E: Mark, we don't have to embrace the cold.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:23.480
Kathryn: Nope.
Mark: Embrace it!

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:25.140
Ethan: You could put on clothes.
Kathryn: Yeah

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:26.020
Mark: Embrace it!

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:27.220
E: Like a normal person.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.180
M: EMBRACE IT!

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:28.880
Ethan: Mark!
Kathryn: Nope.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.880
K: He wants to go out! We don't want him in here! Let him go out! *ominous music restarts*

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:32.380
T: I don't know what to do.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.200
K: Just let him go out! Just let him go- he wants to go out?

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.500
Let him go out...HE'S NOT WEARING CLOTHES!

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.040
♪ Let it go- ♪

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.140
*dramatic chord*

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.520
M: *Demonic Voice* Hey guys!

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.400
*video ends*

